OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith plenty of dry weather. However, a
OL,7,Ffew light, showery outbreaks of rain
OL,8,For drizzle can't be ruled out.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FMostly cloudy through the
OL,11,Fevening and night. A little light rain
OL,12,For drizzle is possible in the evening,
OL,13,Fand then later in the night across
OL,14,Fnorthern Aberdeenshire.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA mainly dry but cloudy
OL,17,Fmorning. Outbreaks of rain will spread
OL,18,Facross from the west later in the
OL,19,Fafternoon, turning persistent and
OL,20,Foccasionally heavier later on.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
